sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant UI as React (Skill roadmap)
  participant API as StudentController
  participant RS as RoadmapService
  participant MS as MatchService
  participant DB as MySQL
  S->>UI: Open Skill roadmap
  UI->>API: GET /api/student/roadmap (JWT)
  API->>RS: forStudent(id)
  RS->>DB: profile levels, CGPA, open jobs
  RS->>RS: candidate actions (skill, target level)
  loop every bundle of 1, 2, 3 actions (about 1,000)
    RS->>MS: reachable(levels + bundle, job) for each job
  end
  RS->>RS: best bundle per size, least effort, "works together" flag
  RS->>RS: cheapest path to each nearby job, CGPA blocker
  RS-->>UI: bundles, closest jobs, plans checked
  S->>UI: Show on my map
  UI->>UI: Career Map with the bundle switched on (what-if)
